  {
   "id": "t1620032900",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60.0,
   "y": 610.0,
   "width": 340.0,
   "height": 230.0,
   "strokeColor": "#EAF4FF",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "A \u00b7 NO FILE\napply 0001..HEAD in order,\neach in its own transaction,\neach writing its own row.\n\nA fresh install runs the SAME\nladder an upgrade runs. There\nis no separate create script,\nbecause the two always drift.",
